{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>And his offering.</b> Since it already wrote ״ויהי המקריב״, it went back and wrote ״קרבנו״ — that is, and this is his offering. Another interpretation: therefore the vav is written in it, so that he not boast and say, I am first among those who bring offerings — for the vav adds to the matter of firstness, as though he were not first." "<b>A silver bowl.</b> What is the difference between a bowl (קערה) and a basin (מזרק)? A bowl — its wall is thick; a basin — its wall is thin."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:16:54.642062792Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}